(3405282, 474414, 35044, '<td valign="top">Caterham super 7?  V nice - I used to want one of those.  <br/> <br/>Nice image - good feeling of speed.  I would like to see both hands on the wheel (compositionally, rather than for safety!) and a fraction more vibrancy in the colours of the trees - they fail to compete with the yellow of the bonnet.<br/> <br/>A slightly straighter road, and/or slower speed with longer shutter, might have captured the blurred parts of the image slightly cleaner, without the ghosting.<br/> <br/>Overall - one of my favourites for this difficult challenge.</td>', 'Caterham super 7?  V nice - I used to want one of those.   Nice image - good feeling of speed.  I would like to see both hands on the wheel (compositionally, rather than for safety!) and a fraction more vibrancy in the colours of the trees - they fail to compete with the yellow of the bonnet. A slightly straighter road, and/or slower speed with longer shutter, might have captured the blurred parts of the image slightly cleaner, without the ghosting. Overall - one of my favourites for this difficult challenge.', '2007-02-26 06:10:14.000000', NULL, 1);
