(3417832, 473649, 68256, '<td valign="top">Perplexing Old Raggedy Tree - 7<br/> <br/>I love the textures, contrast and composition.  I''m a big b/w fan so probably would have like it better in b/w, but that is just personal</td>', 'Perplexing Old Raggedy Tree - 7 I love the textures, contrast and composition.  I''m a big b/w fan so probably would have like it better in b/w, but that is just personal', '2007-03-01 10:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417845, 475354, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Open Wetland - 8<br/> <br/>I love the gentle colors in the sky and water reflection and that lonely bush.</td>', 'Wonderful Open Wetland - 8 I love the gentle colors in the sky and water reflection and that lonely bush.', '2007-03-01 10:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417874, 475348, 68256, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Lighting Mate - 8<br/> <br/>I think I would have voted a little higher with something a little more interesting in the foreground (other than fence posts).  I love the blue sky contrasting with the warm tones of the rock and pasture.</td>', 'Brilliant Lighting Mate - 8 I think I would have voted a little higher with something a little more interesting in the foreground (other than fence posts).  I love the blue sky contrasting with the warm tones of the rock and pasture.', '2007-03-01 10:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417884, 475293, 68256, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photographic Acquisition - 9<br/> <br/>I love the bird flying toward the center of the photo and the deer running into it....very balancing.  I also like the debth with the mountains in the background (although I would have like to been able to see more of them.  Great tie in to the title too.  Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent Photographic Acquisition - 9 I love the bird flying toward the center of the photo and the deer running into it....very balancing.  I also like the debth with the mountains in the background (although I would have like to been able to see more of them.  Great tie in to the title too.  Very well done.', '2007-03-01 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
