(3417931, 472482, 68256, '<td valign="top">Hopelessly Oppressed Person - 10<br/> <br/>Very nice capture.  I think you have nailed everything, even down to the cropped off feet which adds to the oppressed feelings of that girl.</td>', 'Hopelessly Oppressed Person - 10 Very nice capture.  I think you have nailed everything, even down to the cropped off feet which adds to the oppressed feelings of that girl.', '2007-03-01 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
