(3417971, 475370, 68256, '<td valign="top">Surely Noone Attempted Feeding U - 8<br/> <br/>Great play on words and thank you for explaining your acronym in the title so that I didn''t have to use the f word when I read it.</td>', 'Surely Noone Attempted Feeding U - 8 Great play on words and thank you for explaining your acronym in the title so that I didn''t have to use the f word when I read it.', '2007-03-01 10:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
