(3422106, 474630, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept. I don''t know whether the sky was this monochromatic when you shot it, but It feels a little bit artificial to me. If you desaturated it, you might want to try it with a bit more color. There are some artifacts around the dish that bother me a bit. A bit of the ole dodge and burn to boost the contrast of the sky and this would be a 9 or a 10 for me.</td>', 'Brilliant concept. I don''t know whether the sky was this monochromatic when you shot it, but It feels a little bit artificial to me. If you desaturated it, you might want to try it with a bit more color. There are some artifacts around the dish that bother me a bit. A bit of the ole dodge and burn to boost the contrast of the sky and this would be a 9 or a 10 for me.', '2007-03-02 07:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
