(3422429, 474597, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, the zoom blur is not so much that it obliterates the detail, but enough to give a ''dreamy'' zooming look to the image.</td>', 'Nice effect, the zoom blur is not so much that it obliterates the detail, but enough to give a ''dreamy'' zooming look to the image.', '2007-03-02 10:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3422438, 474180, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the fantastic detail in the walls and floor. The lighting seems perfect and quite even; did you use HDR to achieve this? Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the fantastic detail in the walls and floor. The lighting seems perfect and quite even; did you use HDR to achieve this? Very nice.', '2007-03-02 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3422458, 474841, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!! I must say, this looks so perfect as to be a painting. The lighting is great. The boy and the background are illuminated superbly. The light reveals just the right amount of form and texture without being too contrasty. The color toning is great. The composition is fabulous; I think putting his face slightly left of center is spot on and makes the image perfectly balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful image!! I must say, this looks so perfect as to be a painting. The lighting is great. The boy and the background are illuminated superbly. The light reveals just the right amount of form and texture without being too contrasty. The color toning is great. The composition is fabulous; I think putting his face slightly left of center is spot on and makes the image perfectly balanced.', '2007-03-02 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3422468, 474509, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is weird--but cool! Very abstract; I really can''t figure out what it could be? They really don''t look like laser beams, because there are various ''chunks'' of stuff here and there.</td>', 'Wow, this is weird--but cool! Very abstract; I really can''t figure out what it could be? They really don''t look like laser beams, because there are various ''chunks'' of stuff here and there.', '2007-03-02 10:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
