(3423625, 475162, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job of capturing this image.  Yes, it''s been done before, but still worth looking at.  :D  As for your acronym, I have no idea what it is and that''s a minor bummer (that I can''t figure it out from your photo).  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful job of capturing this image.  Yes, it''s been done before, but still worth looking at.  :D  As for your acronym, I have no idea what it is and that''s a minor bummer (that I can''t figure it out from your photo).  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-02 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423638, 474609, 30049, '<td valign="top">Won''t stay cold there for very long!  :D</td>', 'Won''t stay cold there for very long!  :D', '2007-03-02 16:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423653, 473888, 30049, '<td valign="top">That is one cat with attitude!  :D  For some reason this photo seems flat.  Could be the lighting?  As for the title, I would have been hard pressed to figure out the acronym - which defeats part of the challenge IMO (let the image describe the acronym).  Anyway - Good luck.</td>', 'That is one cat with attitude!  :D  For some reason this photo seems flat.  Could be the lighting?  As for the title, I would have been hard pressed to figure out the acronym - which defeats part of the challenge IMO (let the image describe the acronym).  Anyway - Good luck.', '2007-03-02 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423664, 475097, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very creative image with interesting play of shadows.  Well composed, sharp and focused.  Biggest distraction for me is the title - should have let the viewers figure it out based on the image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative image with interesting play of shadows.  Well composed, sharp and focused.  Biggest distraction for me is the title - should have let the viewers figure it out based on the image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-02 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423714, 475209, 30049, '<td valign="top">They are such curious animals, aren''t they.  :D  Cute image, and composed well enough overall.  Lighting is a little harsh (blown highlights on foreleg).  Good luck.</td>', 'They are such curious animals, aren''t they.  :D  Cute image, and composed well enough overall.  Lighting is a little harsh (blown highlights on foreleg).  Good luck.', '2007-03-02 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423720, 473453, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking library.  Nice use of blur to direct the viewer.  The acronym works very well here.  Well done.</td>', 'That''s a cool looking library.  Nice use of blur to direct the viewer.  The acronym works very well here.  Well done.', '2007-03-02 16:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423729, 475261, 30049, '<td valign="top">I would have never guessed what you were trying to tell the viewers with the photo acronym combination (still not sure what it is).  It''s an ok sunset, as sunsets go.  The cloud formation adds interest.  As for the title, it''s too bad you had to spell it out - that was the hard part of this challenge - getting the viewer to figure out the acronym based on the photo.  Anyway - Good luck.</td>', 'I would have never guessed what you were trying to tell the viewers with the photo acronym combination (still not sure what it is).  It''s an ok sunset, as sunsets go.  The cloud formation adds interest.  As for the title, it''s too bad you had to spell it out - that was the hard part of this challenge - getting the viewer to figure out the acronym based on the photo.  Anyway - Good luck.', '2007-03-02 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423734, 475079, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo, unfortunate title (lenghty).</td>', 'Very cool photo, unfortunate title (lenghty).', '2007-03-02 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423736, 475365, 68586, '<td valign="top">I think this is a tremendous shot, conveys the isolation of addiction in a powerful but non-threatening way. a clear 10 for me. well done.</td>', 'I think this is a tremendous shot, conveys the isolation of addiction in a powerful but non-threatening way. a clear 10 for me. well done.', '2007-03-02 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423755, 471932, 68586, '<td valign="top">This looks like HDR software has been used, along with a wide angle lens. It has been used to good effect though. I really like this shot - perhaps the clouds on the extreme left are over dark, but overall It''s really strong.</td>', 'This looks like HDR software has been used, along with a wide angle lens. It has been used to good effect though. I really like this shot - perhaps the clouds on the extreme left are over dark, but overall It''s really strong.', '2007-03-02 17:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423762, 474883, 68586, '<td valign="top">I think this is an exceptional shot and if I could give more than 10 points I probably would. However I can only give 10 so I have.<br/> <br/>My only thoughts are how it would have looked with one of the clock hands leaving the frame to balance the one entering it.</td>', 'I think this is an exceptional shot and if I could give more than 10 points I probably would. However I can only give 10 so I have. My only thoughts are how it would have looked with one of the clock hands leaving the frame to balance the one entering it.', '2007-03-02 17:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3423763, 474332, 68586, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest - I have no idea what QAAM means if indeed it means anything. when I Googled it I got '' Quality Assurance Analyst/Manager '' hmm not sure he''s a Quality Assurance Manager, and ''Quick-Maneuvering Air-to-Air Missile''. Now I love the second suggestion . . but again I''m not convinced. H<br/> <br/>However this is such a great shot that I don''t really care what it stands for, and I''m going to give you a 10. Well done.</td>', 'I have to be honest - I have no idea what QAAM means if indeed it means anything. when I Googled it I got '' Quality Assurance Analyst/Manager '' hmm not sure he''s a Quality Assurance Manager, and ''Quick-Maneuvering Air-to-Air Missile''. Now I love the second suggestion . . but again I''m not convinced. H However this is such a great shot that I don''t really care what it stands for, and I''m going to give you a 10. Well done.', '2007-03-02 17:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
