(3423837, 472336, 69776, '<td valign="top">Retired are we ?  Nice capture but is a bit dak imo, perhaps the focus also got the wall not the people.  Good Luck</td>', 'Retired are we ?  Nice capture but is a bit dak imo, perhaps the focus also got the wall not the people.  Good Luck', '2007-03-02 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
