(3425539, 475046, 38032, '<td valign="top">That''s great! ... Illike the way you captured the puncher so angry and cut - I can easilly forgive the bot of noise considering it looks like sort of a grungy place without spectacular lighting.</td>', 'That''s great! ... Illike the way you captured the puncher so angry and cut - I can easilly forgive the bot of noise considering it looks like sort of a grungy place without spectacular lighting.', '2007-03-03 13:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
