(3428376, 471932, 54674, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and nice subject.  - 10</td>', 'Nice sky and nice subject.  - 10', '2007-03-04 17:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428387, 475103, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is such a great combination of items it almost seems fake (like photoshopped in) - I''m sure it''s not, just an observation.  The clouds are PERFECT, and the timing to get that plane in there - way cool!  Add a curving, meandering road and the speed limit sign - what more could you ask for?  I''d have cloned out the car bottom right.  :D  PDQ - I guess you''re either talking about the plane - or - the photographer reaction - or - the shutter speed.  Very well done.  Congratulations!</td>', 'This is such a great combination of items it almost seems fake (like photoshopped in) - I''m sure it''s not, just an observation.  The clouds are PERFECT, and the timing to get that plane in there - way cool!  Add a curving, meandering road and the speed limit sign - what more could you ask for?  I''d have cloned out the car bottom right.  :D  PDQ - I guess you''re either talking about the plane - or - the photographer reaction - or - the shutter speed.  Very well done.  Congratulations!', '2007-03-04 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428393, 475109, 54674, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2007-03-04 17:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428394, 475075, 54674, '<td valign="top">Indoor shot like this can be improved with WB adjustment.   It is more interesting to see at least one subject''s face.</td>', 'Indoor shot like this can be improved with WB adjustment.   It is more interesting to see at least one subject''s face.', '2007-03-04 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428395, 475343, 54674, '<td valign="top">Wall seems overexposed.</td>', 'Wall seems overexposed.', '2007-03-04 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428396, 475360, 54674, '<td valign="top">Indoor flash needs to be softened up somehow.</td>', 'Indoor flash needs to be softened up somehow.', '2007-03-04 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428398, 471744, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not for sale?  Couldn''t afford the insurance payments for this car!  :D</td>', 'Not for sale?  Couldn''t afford the insurance payments for this car!  :D', '2007-03-04 17:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428401, 474961, 54674, '<td valign="top">Not much in focus here.</td>', 'Not much in focus here.', '2007-03-04 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428409, 475094, 54674, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but this image isn''t too appealing.   I didn''t notice the fingers on the temple until a second look.</td>', 'Interesting concept but this image isn''t too appealing.   I didn''t notice the fingers on the temple until a second look.', '2007-03-04 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428413, 474894, 30049, '<td valign="top">I guess maybe it''s a good thing you put the description in your title, because I''d never have guessed that one.  I would have just figured it meant ''Wow'', like amazing, but then it wouldn''t be an acronym.  As for the photo, it''s "ok".  Looks like it may have been underexposed some and pushed back (water very grainy).  Sharpening left a halo all the way around her body.  I do like how you stopped motion with the water drops coming off of her hand.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I guess maybe it''s a good thing you put the description in your title, because I''d never have guessed that one.  I would have just figured it meant ''Wow'', like amazing, but then it wouldn''t be an acronym.  As for the photo, it''s "ok".  Looks like it may have been underexposed some and pushed back (water very grainy).  Sharpening left a halo all the way around her body.  I do like how you stopped motion with the water drops coming off of her hand.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-04 17:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428439, 474883, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo in a fashion kind of way.  Very well executed with the lighting, focus, etc... Without the description in the title (which is a little bit of the easy way out for this challenge IMO) the connection of T.I.M. to Time Is Money would be quite difficult.  Nonetheless, I wish you luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a cool photo in a fashion kind of way.  Very well executed with the lighting, focus, etc... Without the description in the title (which is a little bit of the easy way out for this challenge IMO) the connection of T.I.M. to Time Is Money would be quite difficult.  Nonetheless, I wish you luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-04 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428444, 475111, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - nice novel for a title.  The desat works very well here to isolate the ball.  Too bad you had to describe your acronym in the title, with this photo it may have been deciphered without the description.  Maybe shortened some to KYEOTB?  Regardless, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great action shot - nice novel for a title.  The desat works very well here to isolate the ball.  Too bad you had to describe your acronym in the title, with this photo it may have been deciphered without the description.  Maybe shortened some to KYEOTB?  Regardless, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-04 17:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428515, 475373, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the expression.  Matches the acronym perfectly!  :D  Image is well thought out and her face is perfectly focused and exposed.  Not really fond of the burned lower half but it does cover (mostly) the blown highlights.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the expression.  Matches the acronym perfectly!  :D  Image is well thought out and her face is perfectly focused and exposed.  Not really fond of the burned lower half but it does cover (mostly) the blown highlights.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-04 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428520, 475296, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  :D  You met the acronym in a couple of ways.  Should do fine with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  :D  You met the acronym in a couple of ways.  Should do fine with this.  Good luck.', '2007-03-04 18:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3428537, 473349, 36988, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge good sir and as always, nicely executed. Good job!</td>', 'Great take on the challenge good sir and as always, nicely executed. Good job!', '2007-03-04 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
