(3428764, 475340, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wine In Glass?  Seems like such an interesting photo must have a more interesting acronym, but darned if I can figure anything else out!  Looking forward to the details on how you shot this one.</td>', 'Wine In Glass?  Seems like such an interesting photo must have a more interesting acronym, but darned if I can figure anything else out!  Looking forward to the details on how you shot this one.', '2007-03-04 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
