(3429686, 475315, 28742, '<td valign="top">14th?? Oh how the mighty have fallen. ;-) Just razzin. <br/> <br/>Great story! You''ve got serious cajones.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Your Notes:</b></div><hr/><i>Major Photoshop juju: Convert from RAW, levels, curves, darkened the shirt, removed a wristwatch, straightened the left shoulder a little, removed a few white spots in the eye patches, generous dodging &amp; burning, Luko sharpening technique (partially), channel mixer for saturation, warm Photo filter on the skin and ball, and cool Photo filter on the blue areas, crop, USM and Neat Image.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dang! I would like to see the original...</td>', '14th?? Oh how the mighty have fallen. ;-) Just razzin.  Great story! You''ve got serious cajones. Originally posted by Your Notes:Major Photoshop juju: Convert from RAW, levels, curves, darkened the shirt, removed a wristwatch, straightened the left shoulder a little, removed a few white spots in the eye patches, generous dodging & burning, Luko sharpening technique (partially), channel mixer for saturation, warm Photo filter on the skin and ball, and cool Photo filter on the blue areas, crop, USM and Neat Image.  Dang! I would like to see the original...', '2007-03-05 05:02:27.000000', NULL, 0),
