(3431260, 475344, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge and the black&amp;white conversion is very nice. The only thing that has let you down here is the motion blur on the package. Although, I can understand that lighting may have been an issue (slow shutter?), but because it takes up much of the image, it''s difficult to ignore.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge and the black&white conversion is very nice. The only thing that has let you down here is the motion blur on the package. Although, I can understand that lighting may have been an issue (slow shutter?), but because it takes up much of the image, it''s difficult to ignore.', '2007-03-05 16:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
