(3431377, 474948, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great example of taking the ordinary and making it something special.  The light sparkles, and those pretty blue lights make it look so ethereal and pretty!    :)   I really like this!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a great example of taking the ordinary and making it something special.  The light sparkles, and those pretty blue lights make it look so ethereal and pretty!    :)   I really like this! ', '2007-03-05 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
