(3431674, 475344, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw treatment of this.  I think a sharper focus would have helped a bit, on the box, because like rinac pointed out, it takes up a pretty large section of the frame, so it is hard to miss.</td>', 'I like the bw treatment of this.  I think a sharper focus would have helped a bit, on the box, because like rinac pointed out, it takes up a pretty large section of the frame, so it is hard to miss.', '2007-03-05 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
