(3433845, 475243, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting you used on this to highlight only the face and let everything else fall to black.  The one thing I notice on a technical point is the eyes - I wish they were sharper.  Looks like the focal point ended up on the tip of the nose and a little softness fell into the area of the eyes.<br/> <br/>Nice score and another great finish.  Well done!  :D</td>', 'I love the lighting you used on this to highlight only the face and let everything else fall to black.  The one thing I notice on a technical point is the eyes - I wish they were sharper.  Looks like the focal point ended up on the tip of the nose and a little softness fell into the area of the eyes. Nice score and another great finish.  Well done!  :D', '2007-03-06 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
