(3454243, 472373, 72581, '<td valign="top">Hi From the Critique Club-<br/> <br/>Hi Kelly! There is A LOT to say about this picture. I can''t see how anyone could have given this picture a 1. I would have given it a 6. <br/> <br/>I love the angle and the black and white tinted brown looks nice as well. I like how you can see the whole picture, not just a little bit. You your cat in a good pose and you can really see the details of it''s fur. The woodwork looks nice against the cat''s fur, too.<br/> <br/>As you have heard in many comments, I wish the paws were not cut off, but it does give the picture an interesting look. I would have cropped it a little bit more. But over all it''s a great picture! <br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'Hi From the Critique Club- Hi Kelly! There is A LOT to say about this picture. I can''t see how anyone could have given this picture a 1. I would have given it a 6.  I love the angle and the black and white tinted brown looks nice as well. I like how you can see the whole picture, not just a little bit. You your cat in a good pose and you can really see the details of it''s fur. The woodwork looks nice against the cat''s fur, too. As you have heard in many comments, I wish the paws were not cut off, but it does give the picture an interesting look. I would have cropped it a little bit more. But over all it''s a great picture!  Great job!', '2007-03-12 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3454262, 474842, 72581, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique club-<br/> <br/>Hi goc! I like your picture! I would have given it a 5. I think you should have done better in the competion, your picture is really nice!<br/> <br/>I love the focus on the bug and the small hole in the backround. The backround is very interesting, I LOVE it. The title really goes with the picture too! <br/> <br/>There is not really anything i dislike in this picture, a little bit more of a crop?<br/> <br/>You did a GREAT job with this photo!</td>', 'Hi from the Critique club- Hi goc! I like your picture! I would have given it a 5. I think you should have done better in the competion, your picture is really nice! I love the focus on the bug and the small hole in the backround. The backround is very interesting, I LOVE it. The title really goes with the picture too!  There is not really anything i dislike in this picture, a little bit more of a crop? You did a GREAT job with this photo!', '2007-03-12 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
