(3454982, 474534, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>"OAP" is defiantly an acronym that I did not understand but I do live in the States.  So after reading your comments it makes a lot more sense.  I thought maybe it was a DPC joke I had missed in the forums.  <br/> <br/>I like that your were shooting with a soft feel for the rose, I think that works well.  I think also that your lighting is extremely good, the background looks very deep and black.   I think maybe if the focus was a little stronger it would have helped with the overall score.  Honestly I wasn''t really sure what the object on the bottom of the photo was until till I read your description.  Overall the idea was very creative I wish more of us had known what OAP meant.  <br/> <br/>I hope to see many more entries from you! <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* "OAP" is defiantly an acronym that I did not understand but I do live in the States.  So after reading your comments it makes a lot more sense.  I thought maybe it was a DPC joke I had missed in the forums.   I like that your were shooting with a soft feel for the rose, I think that works well.  I think also that your lighting is extremely good, the background looks very deep and black.   I think maybe if the focus was a little stronger it would have helped with the overall score.  Honestly I wasn''t really sure what the object on the bottom of the photo was until till I read your description.  Overall the idea was very creative I wish more of us had known what OAP meant.   I hope to see many more entries from you! ', '2007-03-12 21:55:11.000000', NULL, 0),
