(3501487, 474715, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think the strength of this image is exactly what others have said as a flaw...lacking a specific subject.  I think the colors and movement of the flames give it a real abstract feel.   I would crop more into the part on the left of the photo, leaving out most of the bottom and all of the trees on the right....focus on the fire.</td>', 'I think the strength of this image is exactly what others have said as a flaw...lacking a specific subject.  I think the colors and movement of the flames give it a real abstract feel.   I would crop more into the part on the left of the photo, leaving out most of the bottom and all of the trees on the right....focus on the fire.', '2007-03-31 02:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
