(6683144, 474648, 121949, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good maybe a tad dark in the lower left corner. Not sure why this didn''t score better. Might just be the subject that didn''t click with everyone. I have that happen often, on one of my current entries I think the photo is flawless should be scoring much higher than it is but I think the subject is too much for some people.</td>', 'Lighting is good maybe a tad dark in the lower left corner. Not sure why this didn''t score better. Might just be the subject that didn''t click with everyone. I have that happen often, on one of my current entries I think the photo is flawless should be scoring much higher than it is but I think the subject is too much for some people.', '2012-02-19 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094104, 475030, 41802, '<td valign="top">Hi Tlemetry, I think your photo shows a lot of artistic vision.  It is very difficult to photograph something you have created.  Your concept is prefect for the challenge.  The use of thirds draws the eye into the photo.  I like the basic colors you chose; they are simple but easily understood.   I was trying to determine if I like the image with the border or without.  After stepping back and looking at it, I think the border ties the image together, without it the dots would not be contained and might appear to run off.  So I would totally agree with your choice.  I really like the angle and concept.  Best of luck in the future.</td>', 'Hi Tlemetry, I think your photo shows a lot of artistic vision.  It is very difficult to photograph something you have created.  Your concept is prefect for the challenge.  The use of thirds draws the eye into the photo.  I like the basic colors you chose; they are simple but easily understood.   I was trying to determine if I like the image with the border or without.  After stepping back and looking at it, I think the border ties the image together, without it the dots would not be contained and might appear to run off.  So I would totally agree with your choice.  I really like the angle and concept.  Best of luck in the future.', '2013-08-28 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 0);
